WEBVTT

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:15.200
<b><i>Planet With</i></b>

00:01:29.980 --> 00:01:33.440
<b>5 Years Later</b>

00:01:36.900 --> 00:01:38.860
<b>The Dark Side of the Moon</b>

00:01:42.240 --> 00:01:44.200
<b>Observation Subject</b>

00:01:50.880 --> 00:01:52.840
<b>Dragon</b>

00:01:53.740 --> 00:01:55.870
A change has been reported 
in the observation data.

00:01:55.870 --> 00:01:59.010
His consciousness level is 
beginning to gradually rise.

00:01:59.510 --> 00:02:02.790
How much time do we have before he awakens?

00:01:59.760 --> 00:02:05.600
<b>Episode 11: Azrabarakura</b>

00:02:02.790 --> 00:02:06.020
A few weeks, at most?

00:02:06.250 --> 00:02:09.770
Our fleet is traveling from a distant galaxy.
 It won't make it in time.

00:02:10.900 --> 00:02:13.770
I never thought the damn thing would 
actually wake up in five years!

00:02:18.520 --> 00:02:22.670
So you're finally about to awaken, dragon?

00:02:25.230 --> 00:02:28.120
It's been five years since the alien assault,

00:02:28.120 --> 00:02:30.540
five years since the mass comas,

00:02:30.540 --> 00:02:36.460
<b>Takoyaki</b>

00:02:30.820 --> 00:02:36.460
and four years since the mysterious 
massive object appeared in orbit.

00:02:36.710 --> 00:02:40.590
The object maintains
 its eerie silence to this day.

00:02:41.280 --> 00:02:43.630
Sir, are you scared?

00:02:43.950 --> 00:02:47.310
Nothing's happened, so even the
 tourists have gotten bored with it.

00:02:47.310 --> 00:02:48.860
I'm going out of business.

00:02:50.410 --> 00:02:53.980
As you can see, the citizens are upset.

00:02:51.070 --> 00:02:52.920
I'll take one.

00:02:52.920 --> 00:02:54.730
Sure, that'll be four million yen.

00:02:55.040 --> 00:02:59.340
<i>Have you forgotten what 
the messenger of awakening said</i>

00:02:59.340 --> 00:03:01.610
<i>five years ago, during those comas?</i>

00:03:01.610 --> 00:03:04.740
<b>Debate!!
The Alien Problem!</b>

00:03:01.840 --> 00:03:04.740
<i>There are aliens who think 
Earthlings are dangerous!</i>

00:03:04.920 --> 00:03:06.770
<i>We're not taking this seriously enough.</i>

00:03:06.770 --> 00:03:08.500
What, are they talking 
about the alien problem?

00:03:08.500 --> 00:03:20.970
<b>Hiroko Oka
Part-Timer</b>

00:03:08.980 --> 00:03:13.420
I used to be the head of the 
occult research club in high school.

00:03:13.420 --> 00:03:15.830
So I love this stuff.

00:03:15.830 --> 00:03:19.430
But after four years of 
nothing happening, it just gets old.

00:03:20.970 --> 00:03:24.960
You know, it kind of looks 
like a maneki-neko.

00:03:24.960 --> 00:03:28.280
A maneki-neko, huh? It sure does.

00:03:28.280 --> 00:03:31.400
I wonder why aliens pick the things they do.

00:03:34.580 --> 00:03:36.520
Okay, I'll be on my way.

00:03:36.520 --> 00:03:40.990
<b>Ginko Kuroi 
Nebula Military Officer's Aide</b>

00:03:36.820 --> 00:03:39.390
Find Nozomi-chan and catch up to me quickly.

00:03:39.390 --> 00:03:41.580
And don't forget to close the door

00:03:40.990 --> 00:03:45.410
<b>Sensei
Nebula Military Officer</b>

00:03:41.580 --> 00:03:44.630
before you use the short 
warp in the back room.

00:03:45.670 --> 00:03:46.690
Right, right.

00:03:46.690 --> 00:03:48.000
See you later.

00:03:52.240 --> 00:03:52.910
Yes.

00:04:01.630 --> 00:04:05.840
<b>Soya Kuroi 
Nebula Military Officer's Aide</b>

00:04:02.090 --> 00:04:05.840
Now, where is Nozo-san today?

00:04:05.840 --> 00:04:08.100
<b>College Student</b>

00:04:08.100 --> 00:04:10.510
Open telepathy!

00:04:13.630 --> 00:04:15.490
Over there, huh?

00:04:23.810 --> 00:04:25.990
Good morning, Soya-kun.

00:04:25.990 --> 00:04:29.700
<b>Nozomi Takamagahara
College Student
Temporary Nebula Telepathic Unit Member</b>

00:04:26.360 --> 00:04:27.360
Morning.

00:04:27.750 --> 00:04:29.700
Glad I was able to find you.

00:04:30.040 --> 00:04:34.480
Psychic meetings are a 
heck of a way to train, huh?

00:04:34.480 --> 00:04:35.500
Really?

00:04:35.500 --> 00:04:37.860
I like them.

00:04:38.190 --> 00:04:38.790
Why?

00:04:39.170 --> 00:04:43.720
You always look so happy when you find me.

00:04:44.280 --> 00:04:45.500
You're making me blush.

00:04:47.440 --> 00:04:50.240
How's your telepathic training going?

00:04:50.240 --> 00:04:53.230
Shiraishi-sensei gave me 
a level 8 certification.

00:04:53.630 --> 00:04:54.740
Wow.

00:04:54.740 --> 00:04:56.340
I'm still level 3.

00:04:56.340 --> 00:04:58.400
I've got a lot to learn myself.

00:04:58.400 --> 00:05:02.610
Nebula's best telepaths 
are level 20, she said.

00:05:02.860 --> 00:05:04.150
Level 20?

00:05:04.150 --> 00:05:06.850
So they used a thousand 
of those to trap him...

00:05:07.930 --> 00:05:09.120
The dragon.

00:05:10.110 --> 00:05:11.840
I'm getting scared.

00:05:11.840 --> 00:05:14.000
Can I really be of any use?

00:05:14.730 --> 00:05:16.660
I-It'll be fine.

00:05:16.660 --> 00:05:18.670
I'll defeat the dragon!

00:05:18.670 --> 00:05:22.000
I won't let a single person from 
Nebula or Earth get hurt!

00:05:23.710 --> 00:05:25.030
Soya-kun...

00:05:26.810 --> 00:05:28.900
Sorry to interrupt your fun,

00:05:28.900 --> 00:05:31.970
but I'd appreciate it if you could 
take this a little more seriously.

00:05:32.290 --> 00:05:36.920
The dragon is strong. You should 
be prepared to see people suffer...

00:05:37.240 --> 00:05:39.610
So you won't freeze up when the time comes.

00:05:40.110 --> 00:05:42.660
And more than anything, so that 
you won't become its victim.

00:05:49.360 --> 00:05:52.210
Soya-kun said it would be okay.

00:05:52.210 --> 00:05:54.200
So I'm sure it will.

00:05:54.480 --> 00:05:57.410
Soya-kun can do anything if he tries!

00:05:57.680 --> 00:05:58.980
You amaze me.

00:05:58.980 --> 00:06:03.880
When you're with Soya-kun, 
you can see me through him.

00:06:04.280 --> 00:06:08.720
That's one thing even Nebula's 
best telepaths can't do.

00:06:08.720 --> 00:06:12.100
I'm sure you'll be able to 
help Soya-kun a great deal.

00:06:12.480 --> 00:06:13.990
Thank you.

00:06:30.730 --> 00:06:32.430
Kuroi. Takamagahara.

00:06:32.430 --> 00:06:33.330
You're late.

00:06:33.640 --> 00:06:34.870
Takatori-san!

00:06:34.870 --> 00:06:35.790
Hello.

00:06:35.790 --> 00:06:40.250
<b>Benika Takatori
Citizens' Safety Center
Special Defense Unit 
Nebula Temporary Military Officer</b>

00:06:36.240 --> 00:06:38.620
Your training today will 
take place in room C.

00:06:38.990 --> 00:06:40.250
Let's go, Takamagahara.

00:06:40.660 --> 00:06:43.400
Don't you have a meeting?

00:06:43.400 --> 00:06:45.370
I can just hear what happened later.

00:06:45.370 --> 00:06:47.920
I'm a telepath as well.

00:06:47.920 --> 00:06:50.260
I want to train right up 
until we run out of time.

00:06:50.550 --> 00:06:52.190
Okay, see you later.

00:06:52.190 --> 00:06:53.470
Yeah, see you.

00:06:55.360 --> 00:06:57.550
Oh, you're here, Kuroi-kun.

00:06:57.810 --> 00:07:02.900
<b>Hideo Torai
Citizens' Safety Center
 Special Defense Unit Chief
Nebula Temporary Military Officer</b>

00:06:58.150 --> 00:06:59.240
Torai-san!

00:06:59.580 --> 00:07:00.840
Right this way.

00:07:00.840 --> 00:07:02.550
Most of them are already here.

00:07:05.660 --> 00:07:08.350
You've sure grown up.

00:07:08.690 --> 00:07:11.520
I didn't know people could grow that 
much after they got to college.

00:07:11.520 --> 00:07:15.670
Siriusians go into puberty 
later than humans, I heard.

00:07:23.840 --> 00:07:25.340
It's finally time.

00:07:25.510 --> 00:07:27.890
This is the data up through yesterday.

00:07:35.950 --> 00:07:37.430
There you are, Kuroi.

00:07:37.430 --> 00:07:42.140
<b>Harumi Kumashiro
Office Worker
Temporary Nebula  Military Officer</b>

00:07:37.430 --> 00:07:42.140
<b>Miu Inaba
Office Worker
Temporary Nebula Military Officer</b>

00:07:37.950 --> 00:07:39.760
Come over here.

00:07:40.280 --> 00:07:42.140
Come over, Kuroi-kun!

00:07:43.210 --> 00:07:45.090
Inaba-san and Kumashiro-san...

00:07:45.090 --> 00:07:47.730
Didn't you go to the same college they did?

00:07:48.090 --> 00:07:52.510
They forced me to join the judo club
 and kicked the crap out of me.

00:07:52.510 --> 00:07:53.740
I see.

00:07:53.740 --> 00:07:55.980
Ku-ro-i-kun!

00:07:55.980 --> 00:07:57.250
Come on!

00:07:57.590 --> 00:08:00.330
Okay. Coming...

00:08:00.590 --> 00:08:01.680
Hey.

00:08:01.680 --> 00:08:04.920
I've been so busy with work,
I haven't gotten to see you. I missed you!

00:08:05.310 --> 00:08:06.290
What about you?

00:08:07.240 --> 00:08:08.500
Um...

00:08:08.710 --> 00:08:11.130
Kuroi, let's go drinking!

00:08:11.130 --> 00:08:15.760
No, I was finally rid of you 
after you graduated, so...

00:08:16.830 --> 00:08:18.050
What did you say?

00:08:18.050 --> 00:08:20.400
Nothing, Senpai.

00:08:21.860 --> 00:08:26.220
Those two are really nasty to Kuroi-kun.

00:08:26.220 --> 00:08:28.820
Kuroi-kun, your spot is over here.

00:08:29.040 --> 00:08:30.330
Okay!

00:08:30.330 --> 00:08:32.280
I'll be going.

00:08:32.570 --> 00:08:34.900
I'll come by the dojo soon

00:08:34.900 --> 00:08:36.480
and give you a lesson.

00:08:36.480 --> 00:08:37.570
Until you throw up.

00:08:39.590 --> 00:08:41.400
I'll stay away from there for a while.

00:08:43.290 --> 00:08:44.480
Nezuya-senpai...

00:08:44.480 --> 00:08:45.970
Hello, my friend.

00:08:45.970 --> 00:08:47.080
What are you doing?

00:08:47.080 --> 00:08:52.300
<b>Judgment Nezuya 
Doesn't Do Chores
Nebula Temporary Military Officer</b>

00:08:47.400 --> 00:08:48.590
This is him.

00:08:48.590 --> 00:08:52.300
The messenger of awakening,
who destroyed that sealing device.

00:08:52.940 --> 00:08:54.240
My friend.

00:08:54.240 --> 00:08:55.590
I see!

00:08:55.740 --> 00:08:57.930
He's so cool. Cooler than you, Nezucchi.

00:08:56.990 --> 00:08:57.880
An interstellar hook-up?

00:08:58.440 --> 00:09:00.280
Could you not call me "Nezucchi"?

00:08:58.860 --> 00:09:00.680
Come on, Soya-kun. Over here.

00:09:02.050 --> 00:09:03.980
Let us begin, then.

00:09:03.980 --> 00:09:08.940
<b>Kogane Shiraishi 
Nebula Military Officer's Aide
Nebula Telepath Unit Member</b>

00:09:04.270 --> 00:09:08.860
We'll go over what we've learned 
about the dragon again,

00:09:08.860 --> 00:09:10.500
and then get to the point.

00:09:11.210 --> 00:09:17.360
Most of this information came from 
the People of Paradise, via Soya-kun.

00:09:17.690 --> 00:09:19.640
First, what the dragon really is.

00:09:21.110 --> 00:09:26.050
He is a survivor of the People of Paradise, 
the oldest sentient race in the universe.

00:09:26.440 --> 00:09:30.280
When the race chose to abandon 
their physical bodies

00:09:30.280 --> 00:09:33.600
and ascend to a higher plane 
one million years ago, he refused.

00:09:33.600 --> 00:09:36.100
Alone, he summoned his Psychokinetic 
Photon Armor again and again,

00:09:36.100 --> 00:09:37.910
growing larger and larger each time,

00:09:37.910 --> 00:09:40.510
until he assumed the form we recognize.

00:09:41.180 --> 00:09:44.800
He seems to have lost all memory 
of what he originally looked like,

00:09:44.800 --> 00:09:47.140
or where he came from.

00:09:48.040 --> 00:09:52.620
In asking us to defeat the dragon,

00:09:52.620 --> 00:09:59.070
the People of Paradise hope to bring him 
back into the community to which he belongs.

00:09:59.240 --> 00:10:03.680
Nebula has great respect for 
this race of superior beings

00:10:03.680 --> 00:10:05.350
who helped found our organization

00:10:05.350 --> 00:10:09.290
and would like to help in any way possible.

00:10:09.900 --> 00:10:13.540
But we've already sentenced 
him to death once,

00:10:13.540 --> 00:10:16.990
and having done so, it is questionable if we,

00:10:16.990 --> 00:10:21.430
the races of the evolution of love, 
have the right to do so again.

00:10:22.010 --> 00:10:26.390
For this reason, we've decided to ask 
for the cooperation of Earth's psychics.

00:10:26.390 --> 00:10:31.440
They, along with a few volunteers,
 will be responsible for fighting the dragon,

00:10:31.690 --> 00:10:36.150
while Nebula provides telepathic support 
and other forms of aid from the rear lines.

00:10:36.710 --> 00:10:39.840
Please understand that in the end,

00:10:39.840 --> 00:10:43.240
we will be responsible for 
what happens, even if indirectly.

00:10:46.510 --> 00:10:49.710
She's giving both Nebula's excuse,
 and what they really think, at the same time.

00:10:50.140 --> 00:10:52.480
Using an excuse to make yourself feel better

00:10:52.480 --> 00:10:56.010
and not forgetting what you're really 
here for are both important.

00:10:56.270 --> 00:11:01.090
Now, as for the when and how 
of the mission itself...

00:11:01.090 --> 00:11:04.440
I've sent you all the data already.

00:11:04.770 --> 00:11:06.350
Any questions?

00:11:06.790 --> 00:11:09.080
All that introduction,

00:11:09.080 --> 00:11:11.810
and for the important part you just 
want us to look at the handouts?

00:11:12.880 --> 00:11:15.890
It's more important that 
we're all on the same page,

00:11:15.890 --> 00:11:18.120
is what the Generalissimo says.

00:11:19.150 --> 00:11:24.210
"Once it starts, any plans we have 
are going to go out the window."

00:11:24.210 --> 00:11:26.620
That's what Sensei says.

00:11:26.990 --> 00:11:30.160
But that's why we need to make 
sure we all understand now.

00:11:30.600 --> 00:11:32.810
Nebula isn't used to war.

00:11:34.980 --> 00:11:38.350
But they're used to providing 
support with telepaths.

00:11:38.830 --> 00:11:43.340
Let's leave that to them 
and focus on our job.

00:11:44.950 --> 00:11:48.590
Well, all we'll be able to do 
is clear a path for you, anyway.

00:11:49.230 --> 00:11:50.980
You're the one who matters here.

00:11:50.980 --> 00:11:52.940
Yes. We have a question for you, too.

00:11:53.770 --> 00:11:58.030
You're not fighting this battle 
out of a desire for revenge,

00:11:58.200 --> 00:11:59.490
are you, child of Sirius?

00:12:10.030 --> 00:12:13.270
Correct. I'm fighting to save 
the dragon from his loneliness,

00:12:13.270 --> 00:12:16.840
and send him to be with his true comrades

00:12:17.690 --> 00:12:20.380
I'm the only one who can forgive him.

00:12:27.180 --> 00:12:31.640
<b>Yosuke Hitsujitani
Citizens' Safety Center
Special Defense Unit 
Nebula Temporary Military Officer</b>

00:12:28.450 --> 00:12:31.640
Thanks for coming to visit 
Takezo-san's grave.

00:12:34.810 --> 00:12:38.050
He lost his wife when they were young,

00:12:38.050 --> 00:12:41.110
and his son went missing.

00:12:41.540 --> 00:12:44.610
He doesn't have any relatives to visit him.

00:12:44.970 --> 00:12:47.370
Were you his student?

00:12:47.600 --> 00:12:50.060
No, a former co-worker.

00:12:50.060 --> 00:12:51.750
What do you mean by "student"?

00:12:52.460 --> 00:12:53.880
Iaido.

00:12:53.880 --> 00:12:56.950
He was an incredibly good swordsman.

00:12:57.940 --> 00:12:59.120
I see.

00:12:59.120 --> 00:13:05.550
Hard to believe a man like that 
died choking on mochi,

00:13:05.740 --> 00:13:08.580
and when it wasn't even New Year's.

00:13:08.580 --> 00:13:10.060
<i>Shaddup.</i>

00:13:12.020 --> 00:13:14.480
<b>Citizens' Safety Center Special Defense Unit
Nebula Temporary Branch Office</b>

00:13:19.400 --> 00:13:22.490
Huh? Is the meeting over?

00:13:22.490 --> 00:13:24.700
Yeah. Welcome back.

00:13:24.700 --> 00:13:26.160
Come and sit down.

00:13:26.160 --> 00:13:27.730
You're late, Yosuke.

00:13:27.730 --> 00:13:30.320
Sorry. I bought us manju.

00:13:30.320 --> 00:13:31.700
Manju again?

00:13:32.420 --> 00:13:35.440
Anyway, we have our mission day.

00:13:35.440 --> 00:13:37.310
I'll tell you what the mission is.

00:13:38.290 --> 00:13:41.300
Also, make sure you make out a will.

00:13:45.380 --> 00:13:48.080
We're up against an 8,000 meter long monster.

00:13:48.080 --> 00:13:50.300
There's no guarantee 
we'll make it home alive.

00:13:50.300 --> 00:13:52.890
How many meters is 8,000 meters?

00:13:52.890 --> 00:13:55.400
I couldn't tell you. Maybe a hundred meters?

00:13:55.400 --> 00:13:58.650
No way. It's 8,000 meters.

00:13:58.860 --> 00:14:02.790
About the size of a Himalayan mountain or so?

00:14:04.240 --> 00:14:05.920
If you eat too much, you'll get fat.

00:14:05.920 --> 00:14:07.070
Lemme 'lone.

00:14:33.740 --> 00:14:35.050
Scared?

00:14:35.050 --> 00:14:35.980
I guess.

00:14:37.350 --> 00:14:40.390
I guess even you get scared sometimes, huh?

00:14:40.390 --> 00:14:42.230
What? Of course I do.

00:14:43.460 --> 00:14:46.940
Five years ago, everything you did was crazy.

00:14:47.690 --> 00:14:50.450
Yelling and throwing fits even when 
you were surrounded by enemies,

00:14:50.770 --> 00:14:54.200
or charging into crazy attacks...

00:14:55.450 --> 00:14:57.070
It was fun, though.

00:14:57.470 --> 00:15:00.640
Maybe that's just what Siriusians are like.

00:15:00.970 --> 00:15:04.880
Rielians are really easygoing, 
so it surprised me all the more.

00:15:07.990 --> 00:15:09.680
I'm sorry about Riel.

00:15:10.290 --> 00:15:13.460
What happened was our fault.
The Siriusians, I mean.

00:15:15.420 --> 00:15:18.230
You can take revenge on me too, Ginko.

00:15:18.740 --> 00:15:21.320
Like I tried to take revenge on the dragon.

00:15:22.340 --> 00:15:23.010
You have the right—

00:15:23.010 --> 00:15:25.480
I won't.

00:15:27.910 --> 00:15:29.910
Why did you save me?

00:15:30.580 --> 00:15:32.580
Why don't you hate us?

00:15:33.300 --> 00:15:36.460
We Rielians are a race 
of the evolution of love.

00:15:36.460 --> 00:15:38.710
We want to join Nebula.

00:15:38.710 --> 00:15:42.080
We'll save anyone and forgive anyone.

00:15:43.370 --> 00:15:44.540
That's wonderful.

00:15:45.110 --> 00:15:46.880
You're the same, Soya.

00:15:48.860 --> 00:15:53.200
You're no Earthling, but you 
saved them from being sealed,

00:15:53.200 --> 00:15:57.290
and you're about to go off to forgive 
the dragon who destroyed your home.

00:15:57.910 --> 00:15:59.930
You have love, too.

00:16:00.810 --> 00:16:03.520
I couldn't be prouder to
 have you in my family.

00:16:05.640 --> 00:16:08.550
You're my little brother, 
and I'm very proud of you.

00:16:09.900 --> 00:16:12.170
Ginko, I...

00:16:17.060 --> 00:16:19.080
Come to Riel someday.

00:16:19.080 --> 00:16:21.770
I'm sure everyone will welcome you.

00:16:22.200 --> 00:16:26.410
Everyone feels bad for what happened 
to Sirius. Everyone's forgiven them.

00:16:26.410 --> 00:16:30.670
Everyone will offer you a hand in friendship.

00:16:31.460 --> 00:16:35.090
And in their other hand, they'll have 
a plate with lots of veggies on it.

00:16:37.720 --> 00:16:40.100
I'll go... someday.

00:16:45.590 --> 00:16:48.180
Thank you, Sis.

00:16:54.070 --> 00:16:58.620
We will now begin 
Operation: Deliver to Outer Heaven.

00:16:58.620 --> 00:17:00.200
All forces, advance!

00:17:28.300 --> 00:17:31.150
I was dreaming.

00:17:32.070 --> 00:17:34.400
A dream where I became a human.

00:17:35.740 --> 00:17:39.970
One day, I learned that Nebula 
was about to attack the Earth,

00:17:40.400 --> 00:17:43.330
so I shattered my photon armor into fragments

00:17:43.720 --> 00:17:46.190
and gave it to those who were worthy of it,

00:17:46.190 --> 00:17:48.090
awakening the power within them.

00:17:48.760 --> 00:17:51.670
Together, we used that power to fight.

00:17:52.430 --> 00:17:54.840
And we lost.

00:17:55.670 --> 00:17:58.500
What happened to Earth?

00:17:59.640 --> 00:18:00.710
It's fine.

00:18:01.420 --> 00:18:03.470
Everybody's just fine.

00:18:03.870 --> 00:18:07.210
Then why did you come here,

00:18:07.210 --> 00:18:10.940
Nebula, with this survivor of Sirius?!

00:18:12.830 --> 00:18:14.490
I sent them.

00:18:17.660 --> 00:18:19.000
I've come for you.

00:18:20.580 --> 00:18:21.370
Come with me,

00:18:22.080 --> 00:18:24.010
to the place where you belong,

00:18:24.920 --> 00:18:26.340
Azrabarakura.

00:18:27.350 --> 00:18:29.450
Who are you?

00:18:29.970 --> 00:18:32.470
What is that name?

00:18:43.450 --> 00:18:45.140
Begin combat!

00:18:45.490 --> 00:18:48.960
Telepaths and Linked Halo Sealing Device,

00:18:48.960 --> 00:18:52.270
fire morale-draining waves!

00:18:53.650 --> 00:18:58.070
Again? Again, Nebula?!

00:18:58.830 --> 00:19:01.480
You love stealing away people's hearts.

00:19:01.970 --> 00:19:05.170
I regret ever working with you.

00:19:06.110 --> 00:19:08.030
Your love...

00:19:08.030 --> 00:19:10.500
...cannot be real love!

00:19:10.810 --> 00:19:11.960
Something's coming!

00:19:11.960 --> 00:19:13.090
Different-sized dragons!

00:19:13.490 --> 00:19:15.300
Intercept them, everyone!

00:19:15.300 --> 00:19:19.380
Psychokinetic Photon Armor Plus!

00:19:33.930 --> 00:19:36.230
Split up! Protect the telepaths!

00:19:36.400 --> 00:19:37.320
Roger!

00:19:49.620 --> 00:19:50.330
Benika!

00:19:53.540 --> 00:19:56.730
Psychic Spiral Break!

00:19:59.010 --> 00:20:03.300
Psychic... Lunar Drop!

00:20:07.220 --> 00:20:08.440
They're coming!

00:20:08.440 --> 00:20:09.430
Focus!

00:20:11.390 --> 00:20:12.650
Accept your judgment!

00:20:12.920 --> 00:20:14.900
Justice Spark!

00:20:17.840 --> 00:20:19.500
You're so cool, Nezucchi!

00:20:19.500 --> 00:20:21.030
Please stop calling me that!

00:20:42.100 --> 00:20:43.760
Nebula!

00:20:44.730 --> 00:20:49.310
Fools who would interfere with my justice!

00:20:50.640 --> 00:20:52.140
He's here, Soya-kun!

00:20:55.100 --> 00:20:56.900
Tera Cat...

00:20:57.240 --> 00:20:58.940
Grand Stella...

00:20:59.170 --> 00:21:01.490
...Hammer!

00:21:03.360 --> 00:21:06.260
...Breaker!

00:21:15.180 --> 00:21:16.250
Wow...

00:21:16.570 --> 00:21:17.960
They pushed it back.

00:21:22.330 --> 00:21:25.000
Justice forgives no one,

00:21:25.000 --> 00:21:27.260
and without forgiveness, love is impossible.

00:21:27.260 --> 00:21:29.470
And without love, having a soul is impossible!

00:21:29.700 --> 00:21:32.850
I, Nebula, Sirius...

00:21:33.250 --> 00:21:35.080
We've come to forgive you!

00:21:40.240 --> 00:21:44.570
We now release you from the hell 
of maintaining your long-dead body

00:21:44.740 --> 00:21:46.530
with your psychic powers,

00:21:47.150 --> 00:21:49.620
out of your own sense of justice!

00:21:50.070 --> 00:21:52.950
Come back with me, Azrabarakura...

00:21:54.410 --> 00:21:55.880
My brother!

00:21:59.280 --> 00:22:03.370
Oh, he was a big brother?

00:22:07.010 --> 00:22:09.970
<b><i>Next
Final Episode</i></b>

00:23:39.980 --> 00:23:45.270
<b><i>Final Episode
Behold, the Universe
 Is Filled With Blessings</i></b>

00:23:41.830 --> 00:23:45.110
"Behold, the Universe Is 
Filled With Blessings."
